<obfl xmlns="http://www.daisy.org/ns/2011/obfl" version="2011-1" xml:lang="en">
	<meta xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">
		<dc:title>Volume keep with previous, nested blocks test</dc:title>
		<dc:description>Tests keep-with-previous-sheets on nested blocks that end on the same sheet.
		One short block is one sheet. A block with keep-with-previous-sheets="2" occupies sheets 8-11. Its last child, with
		keep-with-previous-sheets="1", occupies sheets 10-11.
		Without the keep-with-previous-sheets, the first volume would be 10 sheets and the second would be 4 sheets.
		The child keeps sheets 10 and 11 together, and the parent keeps sheets 9, 10 and 11 together, so the first volume
		is 8 sheets and the second 6 sheets.</dc:description>
	</meta>
	<layout-master name="body" page-width="10" page-height="6" duplex="false">
		<default-template>
			<header/>
			<footer/>
		</default-template>
	</layout-master>
	<volume-template sheets-in-volume-max="10">
		<pre-content/>
		<post-content/>
	</volume-template>
	<sequence master="body">
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block keep-with-previous-sheets="2">
			<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
			<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
			<block keep-with-previous-sheets="1">⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
		<block>⠿⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠤ ⠤⠿</block>
	</sequence>
</obfl>
